
<h2>You've been invited to join Recs!</h2>

<p>Hi there,</p>

<p>
  <strong><%= @inviter.name %></strong>
  has invited you to join Recs, a place to share recommendations
  with friends.
</p>

<p>
  Once you create your account, you and
  <%= @inviter.name %> will automatically become friends.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Accept invitation and join Recs",
      new_registration_url(invitation: @token) %>
</p>

<p>
  This invitation expires in seven days.
</p>

<p>We hope to see you on Recs!</p>
